#: ../../api/highlevel.md:5
msgid "High-Level API"
msgstr "高レベルAPI"

#: of saealib.api.minimize:1
msgid "Run surrogate-assisted minimization."
msgstr "を実行します。サロゲートモデルを用いた最小化を実行します。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize saealib.api.minimize
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of saealib.api.minimize:3
msgid ""
"Objective function ``f(x) -> float | array``, or a fully configured "
":class:`Problem` instance (in which case ``dim``, ``lb``, ``ub``, and "
"``n_obj`` are ignored)."
msgstr ""
"目的関数``f(x) -> float | array``、または完全に構成済みの {py:class}`Problem` "
"インスタンスです（この場合``dim``、``lb``、``ub``、``n_obj``は無視されます）。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:9 saealib.api.minimize:7
msgid ""
"``'GA'``, ``'PSO'``, or an :class:`Algorithm` instance. If omitted, the "
"library's bundled default preset resolves it (currently GA with BLX-alpha"
" crossover and uniform mutation)."
msgstr ""
"``'GA'``、``'PSO'``、または {py:class}`Algorithm` インスタンスです。省略時は付属の既定プリセット（BLX-"
"alpha交叉と一様突然変異を使うGA）が解決します。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:13 saealib.api.minimize:11
msgid "Number of design variables. Required when *func* is a callable."
msgstr "設計変数の数です。*func*が呼び出し可能な場合に必要です。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:15 saealib.api.minimize:13
msgid "Lower bounds of length *dim*. Required when *func* is a callable."
msgstr "長さ*dim*の下限です。*func*が呼び出し可能な場合に必要です。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:17 saealib.api.minimize:15
msgid "Upper bounds of length *dim*. Required when *func* is a callable."
msgstr "長さ*dim*の上限です。*func*が呼び出し可能な場合に必要です。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:19 saealib.api.minimize:17
msgid ""
"Number of objectives. Ignored when *func* is a :class:`Problem`. Default:"
" 1."
msgstr "目的数。*func* が {py:class}`Problem` の場合は無視されます。既定値：1。"

#: of saealib.api.minimize:19
msgid ""
"Optimization direction per objective. Each element is "
"``-1``/``\"minimize\"`` (minimize) or ``+1``/``\"maximize\"`` (maximize)."
" Default: all minimize."
msgstr "目的ごとの最適化方向です。各要素は``-1``/``\"minimize\"``（最小化）または``+1``/``\"maximize\"``（最大化）です。既定値はすべて最小化です。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:24 saealib.api.minimize:22
msgid ""
"``'rbf'``, a :class:`Surrogate`, or a :class:`SurrogateManager`. If "
"omitted, the library's bundled default preset resolves it (currently an "
"RBF surrogate with mean-prediction acquisition). Passing ``None`` "
"explicitly is not supported and raises :class:`ValidationError`."
msgstr ""
"``'rbf'``、 {py:class}`Surrogate`、または {py:class}`SurrogateManager` "
"です。省略時は平均予測の獲得関数を使うRBFサロゲートの既定プリセットが解決します。``None``の明示指定はサポートせず、 "
"{py:class}`ValidationError` を発生させます。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:29 saealib.api.minimize:27
msgid ""
"``'ib'``, ``'gb'``, ``'ps'``, or an :class:`OptimizationStrategy`. If "
"omitted, the library's bundled default preset resolves it (currently "
"individual-based)."
msgstr ""
"``'ib'``、``'gb'``、``'ps'``、または {py:class}`OptimizationStrategy` "
"です。省略時は個体ベースの既定プリセットが解決します。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:33 saealib.api.minimize:31
msgid ""
"A preset (YAML file path or dict) providing default component "
"configuration. See :meth:`Optimizer.set_preset`. Components explicitly "
"passed via *algorithm*/*surrogate*/*strategy* still take precedence."
msgstr ""
"{py:meth}`Optimizer.set_preset` "
"で指定する、既定のコンポーネント構成用プリセット（YAMLファイルパスまたは辞書）。*algorithm*、*surrogate*、*strategy*"
" で明示したコンポーネントが優先されます。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:37 saealib.api.minimize:35
msgid "Maximum true function evaluations. Default: ``200 * dim``."
msgstr "真の関数評価の最大回数です。既定値：``200 * dim``。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:39 saealib.api.minimize:37
msgid "Population size. Default: ``4 * dim``."
msgstr "個体群サイズです。既定値：``4 * dim``。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:41 saealib.api.minimize:39
msgid "Random seed for :class:`LHSInitializer`."
msgstr "{py:class}`LHSInitializer` に渡す乱数シード。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:43 saealib.api.minimize:41
msgid "If ``False``, suppress per-generation log output. Default: ``True``."
msgstr "``False``の場合、世代ごとのログ出力を抑制します。既定値は``True``です。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize saealib.api.minimize
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:49 saealib.api.minimize:47
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:1
msgid "Run surrogate-assisted maximization."
msgstr "を実行します。サロゲートモデルを用いた最大化を実行します。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:3
msgid ""
"Identical to :func:`minimize` except that all objectives are maximized "
"(``direction = +1``)."
msgstr "{py:func}`minimize` と同じですが、すべての目的を最大化します（``direction = +1``）。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:6
msgid ""
"Objective function ``f(x) -> float | array``, or a fully configured "
":class:`Problem` instance."
msgstr "目的関数``f(x) -> float | array``、または完全に構成済みの {py:class}`Problem` インスタンスです。"

#: of saealib.api.maximize:21
msgid ""
"Optimization direction per objective. Each element is "
"``-1``/``\"minimize\"`` (minimize) or ``+1``/``\"maximize\"`` (maximize)."
" Default: all maximize."
msgstr "目的ごとの最適化方向です。各要素は``-1``/``\"minimize\"``（最小化）または``+1``/``\"maximize\"``（最大化）です。既定値はすべて最大化です。"

#: ../../api/highlevel.md:20:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`saealib.Result <saealib.Result>`"
msgstr "{py:obj}`saealib.Result <saealib.Result>`・結果"

#: ../../api/highlevel.md:20:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Optimization result returned by :func:`minimize` / :func:`maximize`."
msgstr "{py:func}`minimize` / {py:func}`maximize` が返す最適化結果。"
